coach "Balanced"
about "By the book: run to set up the pass, short stuff on fourth, shots when it's long."

offense:
  when game ending and leading by over 0 and to go over 0 and clock under 100 -> kneel
  when fourth down and to go over 3 and not past midfield -> punt
  when fourth down and to go under 2 and past midfield -> call "QB Sneak" or "Inside Zone"
  when fourth down and to go over 6 -> call "Four Verticals" or "Smash" or "Mesh"
  when fourth down -> call "Slants" or "Inside Zone" or "Curl Flat"
  when goal line within 3 -> call "QB Sneak" or "Power" or "Slants"
  when third down and to go over 7 -> call "Four Verticals" or "Smash" or "Mesh"
  when third down and to go under 3 -> call "Inside Zone" or "Power" or "Slants"
  when third down -> call "Slants" or "Curl Flat" or "Mesh"
  when first down and chance 25% -> call "PA Deep Shot"
  when half ending and trailing -> call "Four Verticals" or "Smash" or "Curl Flat"
  otherwise -> call "Inside Zone" or "Power" or "Slants" or "Curl Flat" or "Toss Sweep" or "Mesh"

defense:
  when goal line within 4 -> call "Run Blitz" or "Cover 0 Blitz"
  when third down and to go over 7 -> call "Cover 3" or "Cover 2" or "Cover 1"
  when third down -> call "Cover 1" or "Cover 0 Blitz"
  when game ending and leading -> call "Prevent"
  otherwise -> call "Cover 3" or "Cover 2" or "Cover 1"

lineup:
  QB "Pocket Passer"
  RB "Patient Runner"
  WR "Route Runner"
  TE "Receiving TE"
  OL "Pass Protector"
  DL "Bull Rusher"
  LB "Coverage LB"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Center Fielder"
